    <txtNameAdmin>SÆBY FLYVEKLUB

+45 98 46 64 40
+45 21 75 64 26</txtNameAdmin>
    <uomTransitionAlt>FT</uomTransitionAlt>
    <txtRmk>Gliding activity. 
Cable launch up to 2000 FT AGL may take place.
Aircraft must comply with local restrictions on
departures - valid for all aircraft (except gliders).
When glider activities take place - all motor
powered aircraft performs traffic circuits
north of the field, and gliders south of the
field.
For further information visit www.eksa.dk.</txtRmk>
  </Ahp>
