    <AseUid mid="4745c05b-bf11-4c83-873a-7156556df548" region="EHAA">
      <codeType>CTR</codeType>
      <codeId>EH404</codeId>
    </AseUid>
    <txtName>LELYSTAD-1</txtName>
    <txtNameAlt>LELYSTAD-1 RMZ/</txtNameAlt>
    <codeClass>D</codeClass>
    <codeDistVerUpper>ALT</codeDistVerUpper>
    <valDistVerUpper>1500</valDistVerUpper>
    <uomDistVerUpper>FT</uomDistVerUpper>
    <codeDistVerLower>HEI</codeDistVerLower>
    <valDistVerLower>0</valDistVerLower>
    <uomDistVerLower>FT</uomDistVerLower>
    <txtRmk>During OPR HR EHLE (see EHLE AD 2.3) within UDP.
ATZ Lelystad A is situated in airspace class G.
All aircraft not participating in the aerodrome traffic are
strongly recommended to stay clear of the ATZ.
Before commencing a flight to or from Lelystad, pilots
have to co-ordinate with the aerodrome authority.
Pilots conducting flights within ATZ Lelystad A have to
maintain two-way radio contact with the aerodrome authority.</txtRmk>
  </Ase>
