    <txtRmk>Aerodrome available for national and international civil air traffic with all types of aircraft, with wing span up to but not including 24 m and/or outer main gear wheel 
span up to but not including 6 m on the designated runways, and gliders on the indicated glider strips.

The import and export of cargo and cargo in transit is allowed.


IFR only allowed outside UDP BTN 0600-2200 (0500-2100).</txtRmk>
  </Ahp>
