    <txtRmk>1. Aerodrome available (PPR 24 HR) for national and international civil air traffic with all types of aircraft.
2. Aerodrome available for visiting recreational flights (GA) on Monday and Friday only.
3. When an aircraft of ICAO approach category D operates to or from Twente Airport, the flight crew must have read the local briefing and completed
the mandatory test prior to the flight(s). See EHTW AD 2.23.</txtRmk>
