    <txtRmk>1. Aerodrome available for use by national civil air traffic with aircraft and
gyroplanes up to 890 KG with a MAX wingspan of 14 M, micro light
aeroplanes, micro light helicopters and hanggliders.
MAX noise level Lden CAT 008.
2. Flights between EHST and Schengen Treaty countries permitted. The
import, export and transit of cargo is not allowed.</txtRmk>
  </Ahp>
