During OPR HR EHLE (see EHLE AD 2.3) all aircraft
not participating in the aerodrome traffic are strongly recommended
to stay clear of the ATZ.
Before commencing a flight to or from Lelystad, pilots
have to co-ordinate with the aerodrome authority.</txtRmk>
