    <txtName>ESR102 HAGA</txtName>
    <txtNameAlt>ESR102</txtNameAlt>
    <codeDistVerUpper>ALT</codeDistVerUpper>
    <valDistVerUpper>2000</valDistVerUpper>
    <uomDistVerUpper>FT</uomDistVerUpper>
    <codeDistVerLower>HEI</codeDistVerLower>
    <valDistVerLower>0</valDistVerLower>
    <uomDistVerLower>FT</uomDistVerLower>
    <txtRmk>Special permission by Swedish
Transport Agency is required,
except for operators specified in ENR
5.1 para 2.2.2

With permission obtained from
STOCKHOLM/Bromma ATS, crossing
of the area according to visual flight
rules may be carried out in conjuction
with take-off or landing at
STOCKHOLM/Bromma aerodrome.

With permission obtained from
STOCKHOLM/Bromma ATS or
STOCKHOLM ACC crossing of the
area with manned hot air balloon may
be conducted at lowest 1000 ft AMSL,
unless Swedish Transport Agency has
temporarily revoked this option.</txtRmk>
  </Ase>
