traffic laid out on pages ESMQ 4-5 through ESMQ 4-12 and
ESMQ 6-1 respectively, have been established also for noise
abatement purposes. Aircraft shall strictly adhere to assigned
route and be operated in such a manner that unnecessary
noise disturbances are not caused.</txtRmk>
