    <txtNameAdmin>KARLSTAD AIRPORT
SE-655 91 KARLSTAD
TEL: +46 54 540 77 14
FAX: +46 54 53 23 06</txtNameAdmin>
    <valTransitionAlt>5000</valTransitionAlt>
    <uomTransitionAlt>FT</uomTransitionAlt>
    <Aht>
      <codeWorkHr>H24</codeWorkHr>
    </Aht>
    <txtRmk>* AD Administration MON-FRI 0700-1500 (0600-1400)
* Downdraft may occur on final RWY 21.
* Reduced runway separation is applied in accordance with AIP AD 1.1 para 10.
* Credit card required for payment of airport fee, refuelling etc. Information about accepted cards available via the operations department.
* Glider strip parallell to RWY 03 left side 600x50 m not maintained by Karlstad Airport.
* Magnetic disturbances may occur on apron, mostly on stand 4, 5 and 6.
* An ambulance helicopter is located at the airport. Delays may occur (ref AIP ENR 1-1 para 13).
* Aircraft in line to fuelstation 100LL shall hold on Apron S to keep way clear for ambulance helicopter.

For payment of fuel all major credit cards are accepted. 
Handling: Karlstad Airport Fax +46 (0)54 53 23 06</txtRmk>
  </Ahp>
