    <txtNameAdmin>NON-LICENSED AD 
ARVIKA FLYGKLUBB 
+46 (0)734 64 34 06 
MORE THAN THREE TGL ONLY PERMITTED 
WEEKDAYS 0700-1600 (0600-1500). 
THR 19 DISPLACED 200 M. 
PCL ON FREQUENCY 123.350 MHZ 
FOR 12 SECONDS. 
AFTER DEPARTURE RWY 19, CLIMB 
STRAIGHT AHEAD AND NO LEFT TURN 
UNTIL AFTER PASSING S OF HIGHWAY 61. 
OTHER ACTIVITIES INCLUDING MOTOR 
VEHICLES MAY OCCUR ON RWY, TWY 
AND APN. 
WILDLIFE COMMON IN AERODROME AREA. 
SPORADIC SNOW CLEARANCE. 
CREDIT CARDS ACCEPTED FOR PAYMENT 
OF FUEL. 
INFO@ARVIKAFLYGKLUBB.SE 
WWW.ARVIKAFLYGKLUBB.SE</txtNameAdmin>
    <uomTransitionAlt>FT</uomTransitionAlt>
    <txtRmk>* More than three TGL only permitted weekdays 0700-1600 (0600-1500).
* THR 19 displaced 200 m.
* PCL on frequency 123.350 MHz for 12 seconds.
* After departure RWY 19, climb straight ahead and no left turn until after passing S of highway 61.
* Other activities including motor vehicles may occur on RWY, TWY and APN.
* Wildlife common in aerodrome area.
* Credit cards accepted for payment of fuel.
info@arvikaflygklubb.se</txtRmk>
