    <uomTransitionAlt>FT</uomTransitionAlt>
    <txtRmk>Non-licensed AD 
Roslagens flygklubb 
+46 (0)176 163 08 
info@rfk.nu 
RWY 07 down slope. 
RWY 25 up slope. 
Right hand traffic circuit to RWY 07. 
RWY lights 3 m outside ASPH edge. 
Only 650 meter starting from THR 
RWY 25. 
PCL on freq 123.325 MHz 8 sec 
duration. 
PPR for TGL during darkness. 
TGL not allowed 2100-0600 
(2000-0500) during weekdays and 
1800-0800 (1700-0700) during HOL</txtRmk>
  </Ahp>
